ocal mean time(地理平均時？)なんだな","ts":"1618399723.249100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3RSB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fedfd71d-d583-4582-ae42-be433c6b0b46","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"あーなるほど。。","ts":"1618399684.248400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pmn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d8b8ee8d-9d36-4c5c-a153-87e0c6438d06","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"東京が東経 139 度 45 扮の時刻らしいです","ts":"1618399681.248200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rfM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d351ec6-946a-448e-8069-ee498a226d6f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"地理的なオフセットを算出してるわけで、明石じゃなくて東京で処理することになると+19分付くと","ts":"1618399673.247900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FqHps"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a8fbcb19-5161-4736-b1cf-258e5ac38967","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"9時間は分かるんですが、19分のずれはどこから来てるんでしょう。。？","ts":"1618399635.247000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ttq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3fb67d33-a706-483c-b2c7-ecb4ea208a46","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ちゃんと意味ある作りだから気をつける以外ないな...","ts":"1618399565.246800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7iV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5324313a-fefb-4908-95e9-134eeee7e069","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"datetimeはtzinfoも入れ替えられるのか","ts":"1618399514.246500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z2MTL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fcd8b063-86e5-4e75-9958-99447431498a","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"\u003chttps://qiita.com/shota243/items/91660ece72b5e84c3adb\u003e","ts":"1618399492.246000","attachments":[{"fallback":"Qiita: Python の日付時刻とタイムゾーン - Qiita","id":1,"title":"Python の日付時刻とタイムゾーン - Qiita","title_link":"https://qiita.com/shota243/items/91660ece72b5e84c3adb","text":"使用バージョン Python 3.7.6 pytz 2019.3 tzlocal 1.5.1 更新内容 Python 3.7 で確認 fromisoformat() メソッドの記述追加 datetime クラス...","image_url":"https://staging-qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.qiita.com%2Fassets%2Fpublic%2Farticle-ogp-background-1150d8b18a7c15795b701a55ae908f94.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0\u0026w=1200\u0026mark=https%3A%2F%2Fstaging-qiita-user-contents.imgix.net%2F~text%3Fixlib%3Drb-4.0.0%26w%3D840%26h%3D380%26txt%3DPython%2520%25E3%2581%25AE%25E6%2597%25A5%25E4%25BB%2598%25E6%2599%2582%25E5%2588%25BB%25E3%2581%25A8%25E3%2582%25BF%25E3%2582%25A4%25E3%2583%25A0%25E3%2582%25BE%25E3%2583%25BC%25E3%2583%25B3%26txt-color%3D%2523333%26txt-font%3DHiragino%2520Sans%2520W6%26txt-size%3D54%26txt-clip%3Dellipsis%26txt-align%3Dcenter%252Cmiddle%26s%3D4d8f3d49bd388c13236c988cf550abc9\u0026mark-align=center%2Cmiddle\u0026blend=https%3A%2F%2Fstaging-qiita-user-contents.imgix.net%2F~text%3Fixlib%3Drb-4.0.0%26w%3D840%26h%3D500%26txt%3D%2540shota243%26txt-color%3D%2523333%26txt-font%3DHiragino%2520Sans%2520W6%26txt-size%3D45%26txt-align%3Dright%252Cbottom%26s%3Dc75ba879adb9bab4a5d6a7c55be3cf86\u0026blend-align=center%2Cmiddle\u0026blend-mode=normal\u0026s=697f4223937fa0ce06a28163aa0b3cf5","blocks":null,"service_name":"Qiita","service_icon":"https://cdn.qiita.com/assets/favicons/public/apple-touch-icon-ec5ba42a24ae923f16825592efdc356f.png","from_url":"https://qiita.com/shota243/items/91660ece72b5e84c3adb","original_url":"https://qiita.com/shota243/items/91660ece72b5e84c3adb"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EPAs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"601856ea-660d-477b-bc6b-8c1e88059655","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"なるほど\n\u003chttps://www.timeanddate.com/time/local-mean-time.html\u003e","ts":"1618399484.245700","attachments":[{"fallback":"What Is Local Mean Time (LMT)?","id":1,"title":"What Is Local Mean Time (LMT)?","title_link":"https://www.timeanddate.com/time/local-mean-time.html","text":"Use a sundial to determine the time of day and you will probably be off by a few minutes. That's where LMT comes into play. How is it measured and what is it used for?","image_url":"https://c.tadst.com/gfx/750w/sundial-local-mean-time.jpg?1","blocks":null,"service_name":"timeanddate.com","service_icon":"https://www.timeanddate.com/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.timeanddate.com/time/local-mean-time.html","original_url":"https://www.timeanddate.com/time/local-mean-time.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x3E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e312e88e-601d-4d93-a48c-7de8c398df03","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"Local Mean Time ですね","ts":"1618399454.245300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W87"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d94cd800-9f9e-4385-94f7-d66ab842aac1","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"LMT..?","ts":"1618399374.244700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"slG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"28d046db-b789-4f09-b8ff-7e486b40db46","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"そして LMT+9:19:00 STD というのは標準時からのずれが +9:19 ということでしょうか。。？","ts":"1618399367.244300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8op"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e98e88c-5d30-4548-87b2-26e60045a7c1","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"あーなるほど。 datetime に `replace` というメソッドがあるんですね。","ts":"1618399306.244100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1vMu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"371b7c8e-b7e7-42d5-89f4-e6425305748a","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"*'Asia/Tokyo' LMT+9:19:00 STD*","ts":"1618399130.243900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g6v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"265aa274-c8a3-4f27-85d5-56652ae59016","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"```\u0026gt;\u0026gt;\u0026gt; import pytz\n\u0026gt;\u0026gt;\u0026gt; utc = pytz.timezone('utc')\n\u0026gt;\u0026gt;\u0026gt; from datetime import datetime\n\u0026gt;\u0026gt;\u0026gt; datetime.now()\ndatetime.datetime(2021, 4, 14, 20, 17, 34, 182937)\n\u0026gt;\u0026gt;\u0026gt; jst = pytz.timezone('Asia/Tokyo')\n\u0026gt;\u0026gt;\u0026gt; datetime.now().replace(tzinfo=jst)\ndatetime.datetime(2021, 4, 14, 20, 17, 59, 627393, tzinfo=\u0026lt;DstTzInfo 'Asia/Tokyo' LMT+9:19:00 STD\u0026gt;)```","ts":"1618399124.243700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vEHf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"50546d2b-30b7-473e-ac99-d3522604e973","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"うっかり replace ...?","ts":"1618398800.243100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZTA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a9e6d390-dba7-40ad-889c-cd475175493f","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"うっかり replace 使うと +09:19 になります！","ts":"1618398738.242900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O90o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"315bb224-9724-4308-ad34-ab8f999c5895","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"tz 周りはマジで魔窟なので気をつけてください！","ts":"1618398700.242500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x1Jd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"23074aa5-e254-430b-9fa5-27b7dde74b33","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"呪いの書笑 見たことなかったので見てみます!","ts":"1618398368.241900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xfntj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d36b47ad-d825-4c23-ad15-34fe29e6721e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"timeは処理のルーチンの集合体ってことかな?\nまあ一覧ながめつつ例の呪いの書と突き合せるとイメージ掴めるかもw\n\u003chttps://qiita.com/dmikurube/items/15899ec9de643e91497c\u003e","ts":"1618398339.241500","attachments":[{"fallback":"Qiita: タイムゾーン呪いの書 - Qiita","id":1,"title":"タイムゾーン呪いの書 - Qiita","title_link":"https://qiita.com/dmikurube/items/15899ec9de643e91497c","text":"タイムゾーンの存在はほぼ全ての人が知っていると思います。ソフトウェア・エンジニアなら多くの方が、自分の得意な言語で、タイムゾーンが関わるなにかしらのコードを書いたことがあるでしょう。ですが、日本に住んで日本の仕事をしていると国内時差も...","image_url":"https://staging-qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.qiita.com%2Fassets%2Fpublic%2Farticle-ogp-background-1150d8b18a7c15795b701a55ae908f94.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0\u0026w=1200\u0026mark=https%3A%2F%2Fstaging-qiita-user-contents.imgix.net%2F~text%3Fixlib%3Drb-4.0.0%26w%3D840%26h%3D380%26txt%3D%25E3%2582%25BF%25E3%2582%25A4%25E3%2583%25A0%25E3%2582%25BE%25E3%2583%25BC%25E3%2583%25B3%25E5%2591%25AA%25E3%2581%2584%25E3%2581%25AE%25E6%259B%25B8%26txt-color%3D%2523333%26txt-font%3DHiragino%2520Sans%2520W6%26txt-size%3D54%26txt-clip%3Dellipsis%26txt-align%3Dcenter%252Cmiddle%26s%3D1b77d03ba52a02bb74d23aa9a16dc629\u0026mark-align=center%2Cmiddle\u0026blend=https%3A%2F%2Fstaging-qiita-user-contents.imgix.net%2F~text%3Fixlib%3Drb-4.0.0%26w%3D840%26h%3D500%26txt%3D%2540dmikurube%26txt-color%3D%2523333%26txt-font%3DHiragino%2520Sans%2520W6%26txt-size%3D45%26txt-align%3Dright%252Cbottom%26s%3Dd906d0b6de28c8758cbf954fb64202ab\u0026blend-align=center%2Cmiddle\u0026blend-mode=normal\u0026s=8363767758cb66caf6722ed9327ac55d","blocks":null,"service_name":"Qiita","service_icon":"https://cdn.qiita.com/assets/favicons/public/apple-touch-icon-ec5ba42a24ae923f16825592efdc356f.png","from_url":"https://qiita.com/dmikurube/items/15899ec9de643e91497c","original_url":"https://qiita.com/dmikurube/items/15899ec9de643e91497c"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wye"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eef1f5bc-bc25-40a3-abe1-9527a7f93075","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"Date and Timeはほんと難しいので、うかつにビルトインにしちゃうと更新に支障があるし、たぶんそうかな...","ts":"1618398249.240500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yOM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7bd52902-6647-442c-92ff-e0426c4167da","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"`datetime.datetime.now()`はあるけど`datetime.time.now()`はないんですね","ts":"1618398242.240300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CU+v/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21025d70-54c1-40c8-9d76-b6469edf4548","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"datetimeの部分集合がtimeモジュールというわけじゃなくて、実際は逆の依存関係ということでしょうか。闇。。","ts":"1618398123.239500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"96I7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d4fba1db-cd9f-400e-9c9d-afdc81446850","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://docs.python.org/ja/3/library/datetime.html\u003e\n\u003chttps://docs.python.org/ja/3/library/time.html?highlight=time#module-time\u003e\nビルトインの時刻関係のAPIがtimeでもうちょっと整備されたのがdatetimeライブラリ、みたいな感じ?","ts":"1618398049.239300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MNIA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a808f641-b1f1-41de-9569-540c7b809914","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"とりあえず `from datetime import datetime, date, time` してたんですが、やばそうというのが分かった。\n`datetime.time.strptime` はないけど、 `time.strptime` はあるということが分かりました。","ts":"1618397873.238400","edited":{"user":"UDPT2BZ6E","ts":"1618397896.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r3a+7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eafa18da-b6c6-424d-a580-2dd92c17da2f","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"Pythonって datetime.time と time モジュールがあるんですね。。この2者はどう違うんでしょう？","ts":"1618397806.238200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pVq"}]}]
